o please choose the one you like....\nSachi has a troubled eyebrow, light purple hair tips, and tattoos (chain from her right shoulder to her wrist, black lily on her left thigh).\nMyamu has single threaded eyes, two ring earrings and ribbons in her ears!\n(Myamu is a companion who came with me from an imaginary world.)\n\nTheme◇ Life-size and SD please💜.\nMyamu can be either a plushie or in flight!\n\n Usage◇ I will use it on SNS and distribution apps (IRIAM, Mirativ).\n\n  About the data◇ We would like to receive psd or png data with the address, person, and background separated.\n\n Reference materials◇ https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FbSwIg-7fGN9-SXI1jRHLmKWUWQAUpnj\n\nBest regards...♩\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FbSwIg-7fGN9-SXI1jRHLmKWUWQAUpnj", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hwitmsikt/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2986369, "client_id": 3025775, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/286b361e/uploads/origins/2850e976-7946-4308-8ef7-2ef4b6e9a642?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=140eeb6d22d7f3d6c8830bdc0fd66325", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/286b361e/uploads/origins/2850e976-7946-4308-8ef7-2ef4b6e9a642?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=140eeb6d22d7f3d6c8830bdc0fd66325, https://si.imgix.net/286b361e/uploads/origins/2850e976-7946-4308-8ef7-2ef4b6e9a642?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8432cdbee018f530d53dd1bec7969759 2x, https://si.imgix.net/286b361e/uploads/origins/2850e976-7946-4308-8ef7-2ef4b6e9a642?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0800cf9f996961e9bfa0772409ca0152 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/28